message: "If you use this work, please cite the technical report."
type: software
title: "Calibrated Typed Decisions: dataset builders, student training and released models"
authors:
  - family-names: Moharana
    given-names: Lagnajit
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Code for building calibrated-typed-decisions, a dataset of typed decisions (a text, a question and a set of
  options) whose training questions carry the calibrated option probabilities of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, or human
  rater votes where they exist; for training ModernBERT students on six targets and evaluating them on familiar
  data, a new label set (SNIPS) and a new kind of judgment (PubMedQA); and for publishing the dataset card and
  the two released students.
